  the .cld toolkit -- the half nothing mechanical can enforce. The
  checkers catch a stale index; only the rule makes an agent CHECK an
  index before hunting, and update one in the same commit.

  Adjust the paths if you put the specs somewhere other than spec/.
  Drop the symbol-index section if the repo keeps directory indexes
